        <div class="about-content">
            <div>
                <h3>Objective & Role</h3>
                <p>
                    The objective was to transform raw air quality readings from 2016 to 2024 into an intuitive Power BI dashboard. As the lead analyst, I managed the end-to-end pipeline from initial data preparation to full visualization.
                </p>

                <h3>Technical Process</h3>
                <ul class="case-study-list">
                    <li>Imported raw dataset and identified missing/inconsistent values using Power Query.</li>
                    <li>Corrected column data types and structured numerical variables for aggregation.</li>
                    <li>Wrote DAX measures and created KPI cards to highlight key air quality indicators.</li>
                    <li>Designed trend charts for Average AQI across countries, sites, years, and months.</li>
                    <li>Integrated slicers and a Decomposition Tree visual for root-cause exploration.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

